ragraph\" >The <strong>Voice of the Facility</strong> will passive-aggressively guide you as you go\u2026 but it definitely feels like <strong>something bigger is going on</strong> behind the walls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f645674066f538bb6d1e33c5adbad811.avif?t=1771935482\" width=902 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the RPX community as the game grows, and you might just get a <strong>free boat</strong>\u2026 or even find your name in the credits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f15b405bbc554e9d1efdb93777b8e14f.poster.avif?t=1771935482\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f15b405bbc554e9d1efdb93777b8e14f.webm?t=1771935482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f15b405bbc554e9d1efdb93777b8e14f.mp4?t=1771935482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Giraffe Head Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/4c67d84addd3b55e1cf505cd2af4a918d3493e68/header.jpg?t=1771935482","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 <strong>Giraffe Head Studios Limited</strong>. All rights reserved. <strong>RMF's Ragdoll Physics Experiments\u2122</strong> is a trademark of Giraffe Head Studios Limited. All other trademarks, logos, and brand names are the property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cla